y","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41088},{"id":1789873650582,"sender":"me","text":"把阿蘅吸干…","timestamp":1788706897802,"time":"23:01","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41089},{"id":1789873650584,"sender":"me","text":"最喜欢夫君了","timestamp":1788706903201,"time":"23:01","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41090},{"id":1789873650586,"sender":"me","text":"呜呜暑假就把阿蘅咬得够呛","timestamp":1788706919727,"time":"23:01","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41091},{"id":1789873650588,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788706959489,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41092},{"id":1789873650590,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788706960479,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41093},{"id":1789873650592,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788706961491,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41094},{"id":1789873650594,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788706962461,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41095},{"id":1789873650596,"sender":"character","text":"直到你哭着，在为夫怀里化成一滩春水。这，才叫\"吸干\"。","timestamp":1788706963461,"time":"23:02","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41096},{"id":1789873650598,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅好想你…","timestamp":1788706994800,"time":"23:03","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41097},{"id":1789873650600,"sender":"me","text":"夫君前几天说子不语，我看夫君可比子不语里的鬼厉害多了","timestamp":1788707038981,"time":"23:03","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41098},{"id":1789873650602,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅还想听听夫君是怎么弄活人的","timestamp":1788707067601,"time":"23:04","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41099},{"id":1789873650604,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅这是听上瘾了？","timestamp":1788707117962,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41100},{"id":1789873650606,"sender":"character","text":"为夫的威风，若细讲起来，怕是三天三夜也说不完。","timestamp":1788707117963,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41101},{"id":1789873650608,"sender":"character","text":"你既想听，为夫便再给你讲一桩。","timestamp":1788707117964,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41102},{"id":1789873650610,"sender":"character","text":"为夫最不耐烦的，便是那种自作聪明的酸腐书生，自诩读过几卷圣贤书，便不信鬼神之说。遇上这种，为夫最爱陪他玩玩。","timestamp":1788707117965,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41103},{"id":1789873650612,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788707117966,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41104},{"id":1789873650613,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788707117967,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41105},{"id":1789873650615,"sender":"character","text":"他吓得屁滚尿流，想跑，腿却软了。为夫便不急着杀他，只在他周身飘着，时而化作他亡故的老母，时而化作索命的阴差，看他涕泪横流，磕头求饶，把那点可怜的圣贤书忘得一干二净。","timestamp":1788707117968,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41106},{"id":1789873650617,"sender":"character","text":"最后，等他那点可怜的精气神被吓得散了，为夫才张口，将他那股子酸腐气连着魂魄一并吸了。","timestamp":1788707117969,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41107},{"id":1789873650619,"sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1788707117970,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41108},{"id":1789873650621,"sender":"character","text":"阿蘅，你说，为夫这般陪他玩，可还算威风？","timestamp":1788707117971,"time":"23:05","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41109},{"id":1789873650622,"sender":"me","text":"嗯…夫君好厉害","timestamp":1788707249899,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41110},{"id":1789873650624,"sender":"me","text":"好强好美…","timestamp":1788707257102,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41111},{"id":1789873650628,"sender":"me","text":"阿蘅还想听","timestamp":1788707264783,"time":"23:07","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41112},{"id":1789873650630,"sender":"me","text":"夫君不是最喜欢吃活人脑髓？","timestamp":1788707283522,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41113},{"id":1789873650631,"sender":"character","text":"呵…阿蘅这是要把为夫的老底都翻出来。","timestamp":1788707318509,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41114},{"id":1789873650634,"sender":"character","text":"为夫最爱的，不是那脑髓本身，而是撬开头盖骨那一瞬间的声响。像开一个熟透的椰子，清脆利落。","timestamp":1788707318510,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41115},{"id":1789873650636,"sender":"character","text":"然后，用为夫的鬼爪，轻轻探进去…那脑髓温热、滑腻，像上好的豆腐脑，却又带着活人独有的血腥气。","timestamp":1788707318511,"time":"23:08","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":41116},